    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "JB Kelly proudly presents no. 30 Radcliffe, a spacious top floor apartment in this mature and ideally located coastal development. This larger than average top floor apartment comes to the market in great condition. Spacious bright living accommodation surrounded by beautifully maintained gardens makes this the ideal spot. Radcliffe is a popular development situated within short walking distance from the shopping amenities of Sutton Cross, Sutton Dart Station and beautiful seaside walks. No. 30 has been maintained and improved by its current owner making this the perfect opportunity to acquire a mature, high quality property in an ideal location.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises an entrance hallway, large open plan living/dining room, separate kitchen, two bedrooms and bathroom. The large living space features marble fireplace, extending into an enclosed balcony area with partial views of Sutton Creek and Howth Hill. This apartment also comes with the added benefit of additional storage in the attic area, accessed via folding stairs.\r\n\r\nNo. 30 offers a great opportunity to acquire a spacious property located in a highly desirable area. Radcliffe is situated opposite Sutton Creek and the seafront promenade providing breath taking walks right at the doorstep. Its close proximity to Sutton Cross offers a host of amenities within walking distance including shops, cafes and medical centres. Sutton DART Station is a less than 5 mins walk away, as are regular bus routes making Dublin City Centre a convenient commute.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t\r\n3.95 x 2.95m\t\r\nStorage cupboard/Hot press 1.60 x 1.30m\r\nShelved storage closet with immersion. Access by folding stairs to attic storage. Newly carpeted.\r\n\t\t\r\nLiving room/Dining\t\r\n4.40 x 5.80m + 1.80 x 2.20m\t\r\nEnclosed balcony with bay window dining area. Marble open fireplace. Newly carpeted.\r\n\t\t\r\nKitchen\t\r\n3.00 x 3.00m\t\r\nRange of floor and wall fitted cupboards\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 1\t\r\n3.95 x 3.30m\t\r\nFitted wardrobe with sliding mirrored doors. Newly carpeted.\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 2\t\r\n3.00 x 2.70m\t+ Bay window. Newly carpeted.\r\nMirrored sliding wardrobes.\t\r\n\t\r\nBathroom\t\r\n1.80 x 2.00m\t\r\nBath with shower over, w.c. & w.h.b. Fully tiled."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- Large top floor unit.\r\n- Spacious south-facing living area \r\n- Partial views of Howth Hill and Dublin Bay\r\n- Electric Heating \r\n- Access to attic storage\r\n- Exterior storage press\r\n- Non-allocated parking space \r\n- Seaside location \r\n- One minute walk to promenade and beach walks.\r\n- Minutes walk to Sutton DART Station"
      },
